-- Cluster 1 (printer type/quality) — printer-rental-dubai
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO faqs (id, pageSlug, question, answer, sortOrder, isActive, createdAt) VALUES
('paa-dubai-1','printer-rental-dubai','Which is better for a Dubai office — laser or inkjet?','Laser is the standard choice for Dubai offices: it handles heat, humidity, and dust far more reliably than inkjet, and its cost-per-page drops sharply at business print volumes. Inkjet only makes sense for very low-volume, home-style use. Every device on Sahara''s Dubai rental fleet is laser-based for this reason.',100,1,'2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
('paa-dubai-2','printer-rental-dubai','Is laser or inkjet cheaper for a Dubai business?','Laser has a slightly higher machine cost but roughly 60-70% lower cost-per-page than inkjet at typical office volumes. For a Dubai office printing 2,000+ pages a month, a rented laser MFP from AED 250/month with unlimited toner included works out cheaper than running an owned inkjet on replacement cartridges.',101,1,'2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
('paa-dubai-3','printer-rental-dubai','Which printer brand is best for offices in Dubai?','Canon and Kyocera are the most requested brands among Sahara''s Dubai clients, thanks to proven reliability in UAE heat and dust conditions. HP LaserJet Enterprise and Ricoh MP series are close behind for larger enterprise print environments.',102,1,'2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
('paa-dubai-4','printer-rental-dubai','Desktop or multifunction printer — which is best for a Dubai office?','For small Dubai teams (1-5 users), an A4 desktop laser printer is usually enough. Offices with 10+ users get better value from an A3 multifunction device (print, copy, scan) — our A3 Mid-Range plan is the most popular tier for Dubai businesses.',103,1,'2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
('paa-dubai-5','printer-rental-dubai','Is an ink tank printer better than a standard inkjet for a Dubai office?','Ink tank printers reduce cost-per-page versus cartridge inkjets, but neither is built for sustained office volumes or Dubai''s dusty conditions the way a laser MFP is. We don''t recommend ink tank devices for business use — laser rental is the standard for every Dubai office we service.',104,1,'2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
('paa-dubai-6','printer-rental-dubai','Which printer is best for a Dubai home office with Wi-Fi?','A compact A4 wireless laser printer covers most Dubai home-office needs. Sahara''s smallest rental tier (from AED 250/month) includes free Wi-Fi and network setup, so the printer is ready to use with any laptop or phone on delivery day.',105,1,'2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
('paa-dubai-7','printer-rental-dubai','Do you rent or service Epson printers in Dubai?','Sahara''s core Dubai rental fleet centers on Canon and Kyocera laser devices for high-volume office reliability, but our repair and AMC teams service Epson equipment too if your office already runs it.',106,1,'2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
('paa-dubai-8','printer-rental-dubai','What are the 4 toner colors used in a Dubai office color copier?','Cyan, magenta, yellow, and black (CMYK) — the standard four-color toner set used across every color laser multifunction device Sahara rents in Dubai, from entry A4 models to enterprise A3 copiers.',107,1,'2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z');

-- Clusters 2+3 (why rent / leasing economics) — services/printer-rental
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO faqs (id, pageSlug, question, answer, sortOrder, isActive, createdAt) VALUES
('paa-spr-1','services/printer-rental','Why rent a printer instead of buying one in the UAE?','Buying ties up capital in hardware that depreciates and becomes obsolete within 3-4 years, and toner, maintenance contracts, spare parts, and repair callouts typically add 40-60% to the total cost of ownership. Renting from Sahara bundles all of that into one predictable AED 250/month starting fee — zero deposit, unlimited OEM toner, and maintenance included.',100,1,'2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
('paa-spr-2','services/printer-rental','Is it cheaper to lease or buy a photocopier in the UAE?','For most UAE offices, leasing is cheaper over a typical 2-4 year cycle once toner, maintenance, and repair costs are factored in. Buying only becomes cost-competitive for businesses with very high, stable print volumes over 5+ years who can self-manage servicing.',101,1,'2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
('paa-spr-3','services/printer-rental','What is printer leasing and how does it work?','Printer leasing is a fixed monthly service: you pay one predictable fee that covers the printer or photocopier hardware, unlimited OEM toner, scheduled maintenance, and repairs — without ever owning the machine. Sahara''s leasing plans start from AED 250/month with zero deposit.',102,1,'2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
('paa-spr-4','services/printer-rental','What are the main benefits of leasing a copier over buying one?','Leasing eliminates upfront capital cost, bundles maintenance and toner into one predictable invoice, includes free upgrades as your office grows (our ''Growth Guard'' policy), and removes any resale or disposal hassle at end of contract.',103,1,'2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
('paa-spr-5','services/printer-rental','Is printer leasing tied to a specific brand like HP?','No — leasing is a service model, not a brand. Sahara leases Canon, Kyocera, HP, Ricoh, Xerox, Brother, Sharp, and Epson equipment under the exact same zero-deposit, all-inclusive terms.',104,1,'2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
('paa-spr-6','services/printer-rental','What happens when a printer lease ends in the UAE?','At the end of your Sahara rental contract, we collect the equipment at no charge. You can renew the same plan, upgrade to newer equipment, or simply return the machine — there are no exit fees and no disposal costs.',105,1,'2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
('paa-spr-7','services/printer-rental','How do I get out of a printer lease early?','Our ''Growth Guard'' policy lets you upgrade to different equipment at any point in the contract with no termination penalty. If you need to end a lease early rather than upgrade, contact your account manager — Sahara''s contracts are built around flexible terms, not lock-in fees.',106,1,'2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
('paa-spr-8','services/printer-rental','What''s included in the monthly printer leasing payment?','One fixed AED fee covers the machine, unlimited genuine OEM toner, scheduled preventive maintenance, all repairs and parts, and free delivery — there are no metered per-page charges or hidden add-ons on Sahara''s standard plans.',107,1,'2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
('paa-spr-9','services/printer-rental','Do I need to negotiate my printer lease rate in the UAE?','No — Sahara publishes transparent tiered pricing from AED 250 to AED 2,000/month based on device class and volume, with automatic discounts for multi-machine fleet contracts (3+ units).',108,1,'2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
('paa-spr-10','services/printer-rental','Does printer or copier leasing work the same way as computer/IT leasing?','The underlying principle is similar — a fixed monthly fee instead of a capital purchase — but Sahara specializes specifically in printers, photocopiers, and multifunction devices, so our plans bundle toner and print-specific maintenance that a generic computer lease wouldn''t include.',109,1,'2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z'),
('paa-spr-11','services/printer-rental','What is a managed print program and does Sahara offer one?','A managed print program (sometimes called a ''printing enterprise'' setup) consolidates multiple devices across an office or multiple sites under one contract, with unified billing, proactive toner monitoring, and quarterly usage reporting. Sahara offers this for corporate clients with 3+ machines or multi-location fleets.',110,1,'2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z');
